    "title": "Tampa Waymo Drives Into Oncoming Bucs Traffic, Riders Flee in Fear - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Marc Wright ,\n15 hours ago A group of young men riding in a driverless Waymo outside Raymond James Stadium got more than they bargained for Sunday when their robotaxi turned north onto North Himes Avenue, straight into a wall of oncoming post-game traffic. The passengers abandoned the vehicle out of concern for their safety as it got stuck and blocked a lane, according to video of the incident. Read full article\n7",
